<title>USA: IHOP Corp February same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>IHOP Corp February same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>GLENDALE, Calif. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>IHOP Corp said Thursday that same-store sales for the fiscal month of February were up 3.3 percent from the same period last year.</p>
<p>As of December 31, the company had 729 restaurants, of which 535 were operated by franchisees, 58 by the company and 136 by area licensees.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
